  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening nutritious and sustainable value chains in the Caribbean through Alliances</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;This action aims at enhancing resilience and (environmental, social and economic) sustainability of food systems in the Caribbean, to promote food security and nutrition, particularly for groups in vulnerable situations. This will be done by strengthening selected agriculture and fisheries sustainable nutrition and gender sensitive value-chains at local and regional levels through productive and commercial Alliances.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
